invariant: INV-73
file: src/tcp_read.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_test
reason: a record whose tag fails stays in the caller's input, the
  ciphertext where the two-pass ChaCha20-Poly1305 open wrote nothing, so a
  caller that reads its own buffer after a failure finds the bytes the
  ruling has the session wipe.

--- old
    if (w->opened > 0) {
        ct_wipe(w->p, w->opened);
    }
--- new
